@scope
(MDN) - “CSS
@scope
”, Juan Diego Rodríguez (CSS-Tricks) - Firefox 146 Release Notes (Firefox)
- Browser Support (CanIUse)
- Popular CSS Frameworks (State of CSS 2024)
